### Implementation Details
The Analytics component is correctly positioned in the main.tsx file:
```typescript
createRoot(rootEl).render(
  <trpc.Provider client={trpcClient} queryClient={queryClient}>
    <QueryClientProvider client={queryClient}>
      <App />
      <Analytics />  // ✅ Properly placed at root level
    </QueryClientProvider>
  </trpc.Provider>
);
```

This follows the official Vercel documentation for React/Vite projects, where the Analytics component should be added at the root level of the application.

