## Next Steps for User
To enable data collection, ensure:
1. **Deploy to Vercel**: The analytics will only collect data when deployed to Vercel
2. **Enable in Dashboard**: Go to your Vercel project dashboard → Analytics tab → Enable Web Analytics
3. **Verify**: After deployment, check the Network tab for requests to `/_vercel/insights/*`

## No Changes Made
Since Vercel Web Analytics was already properly configured according to the latest official documentation, no code changes were necessary. The implementation follows best practices for Vite + React applications.
